{"id":"basura","lemma":"basura","pos":"noun","rank":644,"glosses":["trash, waste, garbage, rubbish, nonsense","something trashy or undesirable"],"ipa":"/baˈsuɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"basuras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-basura.wav","examples":[{"text":"No te olvides de sacar la basura.","en":"Don't forget to take out the garbage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/823759","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to forget","l":"olvidar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to put out, to get out"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿A quién le toca sacar la basura?","en":"Whose turn is it to take out the garbage?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600156","words":[{"g":"to"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"kerchief, turban cloth"},{"g":"to put out, to get out"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Eso es basura.","en":"This is garbage.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442120","words":[null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Lleva afuera la basura.","en":"Take the garbage out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454795","words":[{"g":"to take somewhere","l":"llevar"},{"g":"out, outside"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ya he sacado la basura.","en":"I've already taken out the trash.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061858","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to put out, to get out","l":"sacar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}